  m_Name: Carta_SemaforosAdaptativos
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Sem\xE1foros Adaptativos"
  _titleEn: Adaptive Traffic Lights
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Sem\xE1foros adaptativos mudam o tempo de verde conforme o fluxo medido
    por sensores, em vez de seguir um ciclo fixo."
  _summaryEn: Adaptive traffic lights change green times according to traffic measured
    by sensors, instead of following a fixed cycle.
  _realWorld: "O sistema SCATS, criado na Austr\xE1lia nos anos 1970, controla hoje
    sem\xE1foros em mais de 200 cidades pelo mundo."
  _realWorldEn: The SCATS system, created in Australia in the 1970s, now controls
    traffic lights in more than 200 cities worldwide.
  _tradeOffs: "Os sensores precisam de manuten\xE7\xE3o constante, e um tr\xE2nsito
    mais fluido pode atrair mais carros."
  _tradeOffsEn: Sensors need constant maintenance, and smoother traffic can attract
    more cars.
  _sources:
  - Label: SCATS (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sydney_Coordinated_Adaptive_Traffic_System
